Example: 201. MSD is 2. Other digits: 0, 1. $2 > 0$ and $2 > 1$. Yes.
Example: 35. MSD 3. Other digits 5. $3 \ngtr 5$. No.
Example: 202. MSD 2. Other digits 0, 2. $2 \ngtr 2$. No.
Example: 100. MSD 1. Other digits 0, 0. $1 > 0$. Yes.
